      "version": "2.0",
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "",
        "lang": "None",
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / TWO-OPERATOR FM VOICE\nFM VOICE PERFORMANCE PATCH\n\nPlay MIDI notes. MIDI pitch controls FM Voice\nat 1 V/oct; MIDI gate opens the ADSR/VCA.\nThe FM carrier feeds the VCA and host output.\n\nRATIO=2; INDEX=2.5 radians; FEEDBACK=18%.\nTry subtle INDEX sweeps for evolving bells.\nIndex=0 returns a pure sine. The modulator\nis available separately at the MOD output.\nHigh index/ratio/feedback may alias!\nKeep monitor level low and audition first.\n\nSource graph only; no host runtime certified.\n",
        "width": 27
      },
